hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"75","[AI-translation] Main Allah se maghfirat chahta hun [teen bar]. Ae Allah! Tu hi salam hai, Tujhi se salamti hai; Tu babarkat hai, ae jalal wa ikram wale. [Farz namaz ke baad padhe]"
"76","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. Ae Allah! Tu jo de use rokne wala nahin, Tu jo roke use dene wala nahin; maldar ka maal tere pas faida nahin deta. [Farz namaz ke baad padhe]"
"77","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. Allah ke baghair koi taqat-quvvat nahin. Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; hum sirf usi ki ibadat karte hain. Nemat usi ki hai, fazl usi ka hai, khubsurat tareef usi ki hai. Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin—us ke liye deen ko khalis karte hue, chahe kafir napasand karein."
"78","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai, tareef Allah ke liye hai, Allah sab se bada hai [har ek taintees bar]; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. [Farz namaz ke baad padhe]"
"79","[AI-translation] Rahman wa Raheem Allah ke naam se. Kaho: Woh Allah ek hai. Allah beniyaz hai. Na us ne jana aur na woh jana gaya. Aur us ka koi hamsar nahin. [surah Al-Ikhlas:1-4] Rahman wa Raheem Allah ke naam se. Kaho: makhluq ke shar se subah ke Rab ki panah chahta hun; andhera chha jaane par raat ke shar se; girhon mein phunkne waliyon ke shar se; hasad kare to hasid ke shar se. [surah Al-Falaq:1-5] Rahman wa Raheem Allah ke naam se. Kaho: logon ke Rab, logon ke Badshah, logon ke mabud ki panah chahta hun; peeche hatne wale waswasa dalne wale ke shar se; jo logon ke seenon mein waswasa dalta hai; jinnon aur insanon [mein se]. [surah An-Naas:1-6] [Har namaz ke baad padhe; Maghrib aur Fajr ke baad teen-teen bar]"
"80","[AI-translation] Allah; us ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh zinda hai, qayam rakhne wala hai; use oongh-neend nahin pakadti. Aasmanon-zameen mein jo hai usi ka hai. Us ki ijazat ke baghair us ke pas kaun sifarish karega? Un ke aage-peeche jo hai woh janta hai; us ke ilm mein se kuch nahin gherte—woh jo chahe us ke siwa. Us ki kursi aasmanon-zameen ko ghere hai; un ki hifazat use thakati nahin; woh buland, Azeem hai. [Aayatul-Kursi; har namaz ke baad padhe]"
"81","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh zinda karta hai aur maut deta hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. [Maghrib aur Fajr ke baad das-das bar padhe]"
